#~ "controller, который поддерживает описание "
#~ "логики чтения и записи артефактов на "
#~ "языке groovy (в перспективе добавятся "
#~ "другие языки вроде Kotlin)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**controller.type** - controller type for "
#~ "the artifact type. Defines the logic "
#~ "for loading artifacts from the directory"
#~ " and writing to the directory. json"
#~ " is the simplest and most "
#~ "understandable controller, which should be "
#~ "used when adding simple artifact types."
#~ " For complex cases, there is a "
#~ "script controller that supports describing "
#~ "the logic for reading and writing "
#~ "artifacts in Groovy (other languages "
#~ "like Kotlin will be added in the"
#~ " future)."

